  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. At dev 100b6fbb6e, method_call_recovery.py:398 still uses min(abs(hint.line-call.line)); _hint_agrees_with_declared is short-name equality with no subclass carve-out. Fixture: caller(thing) builds Runner() and Other(), and thing.run() is bound to Other.run by the linker with no receiver_type_hint. Since filing, refusals for a stated module (f0b158b92c), a declared non-callable (d09b61afd5) and field_chain receivers narrow part (1); P2 WI-fihun measured part (1) on Python (14/62 wrong). Parts (2),(3) are unmeasured. MECHANISM: with no receiver type stamped, a class hint is chosen by line proximity, not by evidence about the receiver; the declared-type guard has no subclass carve-out. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-fihun."  # 0274
